_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 24
---
order: 24
---
short_label: VI.24
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: In any parallelogram the parallelograms about the diameter are similar both to the whole and to one another.
----
proof:

Let {ABCD|ABCDt} be a parallelogram, and {AC} its diameter, and let {EG} and {HK} be parallelograms about {AC}.

I say that each of the parallelograms {EG} and {HK} is similar both to the whole {ABCD|ABCDt} and to the other.

